<h2>JavaScript Statements</h2>

<p>A <b>JavaScript program</b> is a list of
<b>statements</b> to be executed by a computer.</p>

<p id="demo"></p>

<script>
var x, y, z; // Statement 1
x = 5; // Statement 2
y = 6; // Statement 3
z = x + y; // Statement 4

document.getElementById("demo").innerHTML =
"The value of z is " + z + ".";

</script>
<h2> Operator</h2>
<p id="demo"></p>
<script>
<!--Addition-->
//*use +, -, *, / operators*/
